    },
    {
      "id": "91618232c6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "1. I delete the database file for error how can i recover the tombs?"
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6b1e900ef7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "- No problem, there is a folder with a backup every time you reload the plugin. If you reload the plugin 10 times you have 10 backup in backup folder."
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "46b0bb9b20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "2. Is possible create an hologram?"
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b66b6fbbe4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "- Yes, but you have to use one plugin of this: DecentHolograms, FancyHolograms or CMI and activate the compatibility in config.yml."
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "73c5981662",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "3. There is a way to delete the compass from inventory?"
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9d3b762760",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "- Yes, there are more ways: ignoring the tomb with the command, ignore the tomb with the compass and follow the instructions, or wait that the tomb despawn automatically."
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bbc9a4768b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "4. Is possible have the same database for more servers?"
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f4a6e0f8b4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "- Yes, is possible but at one condition, use MySql database type. The other two types is only for single server."
      },
      "tunes": {
        "AlignmentTune": {
          "alignment": "left"
        },
        "TextVariantTune": ""
      }
    },
